    "title": "Contact directory",
    "description": "A searchable contact table for visitors (filter by department, tap to call or mail), and a managed list for editors.",
    "tags": [
        "cms-in-cms",
        "list only",
        "directory",
        "translatable"
    ],
    "_comment": "CMS-in-CMS template: a Contact Directory in two pages (list only, no detail page). PUBLIC: /contacts is a read-only data view as a table (search in name, department and mail, sort, filter by department, paging) of the table of the list \"@section:contacts-cms-list\". CMS: /cms/contacts is ONE entry-form-list that is the form: add and edit contacts in a dialog, delete them and restore earlier versions. The inputs sit directly inside the list. data_tables[] carries the columns and sample rows (import with options.importData=true). The department is translatable. Content locales: de-CH + en-GB. Pages are not open to guests until you set their access. Import via Admin > CMS Apps > Import template. NOT auto-seeded.",
